| 691202B       | 30.6945 |        1 | PC         |         7.43 |
| 691205B       | 25.3479 |        1 | PC         |         7.43 |
| 691206B       | 25.3479 |        1 | PC         |         7.43 |
| 691217B       | 34.4622 |        1 | PC         |         7.43 |
| 691218B       | 34.4622 |        1 | PC         |         7.43 |
