This report provides an analytical overview of the current customer portfolio, focusing on several key identity dimensions and activity statuses within the organization’s client records. The table presented below, which outlines customer attributes such as CustomerID, Name, UserID, account activity, and identified contact information, forms the basis of this analysis. Examination of this data reveals salient trends regarding customer engagement and the structure of stored personal information.

