| nan         | nan                                                                 | and cells with "pick up date" AND "city2" to be auto filled with [Person_3]                   | nan            | nan              |
| nan         | nan                                                                 | and cells containing "city1" or "city2" WITHOUT the words "pick up date" to be left alone     | nan            | nan              |
