These insights lend themselves well to strategic interpretation regarding workforce utilization and scheduling efficiency. A hypothetical comparison of overtime accumulation might clarify the operational impact. Consider the following illustrative table of overtime hours derived by subtracting a standard 40-hour workweek equivalent from regular hours recorded:

