=== Report ===
The form provided reflects the structure and requirements for individuals seeking to become supporting members of HelpAlliance e.V., a charitable entity. Emphasis is placed on flexible contribution levels, selectable payment intervals, and streamlined procedural steps for both monetary authorization and information dissemination.

Contribution options are prominently featured, allowing potential supporters to choose predefined monthly amounts—such as 2 €, 10 €, 20 €, 30 €, or 50 €—with additional flexibility to specify an alternative amount of their choosing. Furthermore, the form highlights the authorization process for recurring debits, reinforcing both the requirement for a German bank account and the reversibility of any payment authorization at any time.

To support donors’ preferences for periodic giving, the form enables contributors to select among annual, semiannual, or monthly debit intervals. Notably, it suggests that the lowest contribution level (1 € per month) can only be debited on an annual basis. The document further outlines the option for supporters to set up a standing order themselves, providing comprehensive bank details of HelpAlliance e.V., including account numbers and relevant international identifiers (IBAN and BIC).

Communication from the organization is tailored to supporter preferences as well. Donors may request the Annual Report either by e-mail or post, with electronic delivery also serving as the exclusive distribution method for the newsletter.

Personal information fields are designated for thorough data collection: name, first name, street, postal code and place, country, e-mail, and (when applicable) LH-Dept. There is an additional space where donors may indicate a specific project to support, offering a personalized dimension to their contribution.

