| nan                                                         | nan            | Feline                                                                                              | [Person_2]   | Can't Afford |


This architecture demonstrates the functional utility and flexibility of cascading validation lists in complex data entry forms, particularly where the integrity of multi-tiered classification is critical. Yet, the need for auxiliary automation to address state dependencies and synchronization underscores the practical trade-offs when constructing highly interactive spreadsheets without dedicated database-backed constraints.

To better visualize the cascading principle, consider this hypothetical example where animal classes and types are linked with concrete animal names:

