=== Report ===
Over the course of May and June 2022, a consistent pattern emerges in a series of categorical indicators distributed across multiple entries. These entries, labeled from “b” through “n,” reveal recurring marks in specific categories, signaling steady dispositions or assignments over the two months.

Entry “b” consistently registers a value of 2 in one category and is marked “A” in two additional categories. This suggests a stabilized classification or state, possibly denoting a routine condition or status that remains unchanged month to month.

Entry “d” presents a distinctive pattern of recurring “NWD” indicators distributed across several columns, coupled with a solitary “A” in the latter part of the dataset. The repeated appearance of “NWD” might denote a specific classification or designation applied consistently across several parameters, hinting at a specialized role or status.

