| B                                                                                                                                | 2002-01-02 00:00:00 | C       |       6 | 2006-01-01 00:00:00 | 2006-02-01 00:00:00 |
| B                                                                                                                                | 2002-01-03 00:00:00 | A       |       7 | 2007-01-01 00:00:00 | 2007-02-01 00:00:00 |
