| C                                                                                                                                | 2006-01-02 00:00:00 | C       |       9 | 2009-01-01 00:00:00 | 2009-02-01 00:00:00 |
| C                                                                                                                                | 2009-01-03 00:00:00 | A       |      10 | 2010-01-01 00:00:00 | 2010-02-01 00:00:00 |
