Over the course of several months spanning late 2019 to mid-2020, multiple users engaged with various modules and features related to Resco Mobile CRM and its associated configuration tools. The activities captured reflect a diverse set of interactions, from early-stage overview examinations to detailed customizations and business logic implementations.

